        "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
        "revision": 1317192386,
        "heading": "Toxicity",
        "text": "Toxicity is documented in most members of the genus Euphorbia. Individuals sensitive to latex are known to have strong reactions, including dermatitis and anaphylaxis, to the latex exuded by this plant.",
